OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Fears over the AI boom   
OL,4,Ahaven't gone away                      
OL,6,FAs the market bell rang out at the     
OL,7,FNasdaq today, the Nvidia super-bounce  
OL,8,Ffaded.                                 
OL,10,FIts shares slid and are down almost 30%
OL,11,Fover the past six months, well before  
OL,12,Fthe scandal involving Jensen Huang     
OL,13,Femerged earlier this month.            
OL,15,FThe legitimate fears about the staying 
OL,16,Fpower of the tech boom pre-dated       
OL,17,FHuang's exit. They have not gone away  
OL,18,Fwith his return.                       
